      "expectation": "DATA-A14 The cart is purely local (database table `carts`, one row per goodsId, specs stored as a JSON list with count per spec). Adding the same product merges into its row, and the cart is not synced to the server\nDATA-A15 When changing a cart spec's quantity, the whole product row is deleted once every spec's quantity is ≤0. Deleting one spec deletes the row when no specs remain\nDATA-A16 Viewing a product detail writes a footprint (goodsId as primary key, overwrite, refreshing viewTime). Footprints are sorted by viewTime descending, the \"Me\" page shows the latest 8, and they can be cleared all at once\nDATA-A17 Search history is stored with the trimmed keyword as primary key (blank ignored, a repeated search refreshes its time). It is sorted by time descending and the search page shows the latest 10\nDATA-A18 Checkout data passes through persistence keys `carts` (cart items selected for checkout) and `selectedGoodsList` (selected goods), both cleared after an order is placed. Theme uses `settings_theme_mode`/`settings_theme_color`, the onboarding flag uses `guide_shown`, and remembered account uses `saved_phone`/`saved_password`\nDATA-A25 Local database name is `coolmall-database` (version 1), with the three tables `carts`, `footprints`, `search_history`. List queries are observable, and the UI refreshes automatically when data changes",
