      "expectation": "INIT-A01 应用级初始化：Application.onCreate（app/src/main/java/com/joker/coolmall/Application.kt:27-37，5 行）在安卓先于任何页面执行——其中每项初始化须接入 EntryAbility.onCreate 并在首页前完成，无鸿蒙等价的逐项记降级\nLAUNCH-A18 At app startup, initialization runs in order: Toast → Log → local KV storage (MMKV) → QQ SDK, and the global login state (AppState.initialize) is restored only after KV storage is ready\nLAUNCH-A20 After logging in and cold-restarting the app, the logged-in state and user info are kept (no need to log in again)\nLAUNCH-A23 The app is edge-to-edge: page content draws under the status bar and navigation bar, and each page handles safe-area insets itself\nLAUNCH-A29 Page transitions use horizontal slides: going forward the new page slides in from the right, going back it slides out to the right; predictive back uses the same back animation\nLAUNCH-A30 Navigation commands issued before the navigation host is ready are queued and run in order once the host is attached, so none are lost\nLAUNCH-A31 When the back stack has only one page, the in-app back action does not pop the last page (the root page is kept)\nLAUNCH-A32 The toast style follows the system dark mode: a light/white toast in dark mode and a black toast in light mode, switching when the system theme changes\nLAUNCH-A33 The app display name is `青商城`; the launcher shows the app icon\nLAUNCH-A34 At startup the QQ login SDK is initialized with AppId `102756675`, and the QQ login result callback is returned to the login flow through Activity results",
