      "expectation": "LAUNCH-A01 On cold start the first page on the app back stack is the splash page (not the home page)\nLAUNCH-A02 The splash page shows the app logo in the center, a large blurred logo as background, the app name `青商城` below it, and the copyright line `© 2025 Joker.X & CoolMallKotlin Contributors`\nLAUNCH-A03 The splash background uses the theme surface color and follows light/dark mode (white in light mode, `#1B1B1B` in dark mode)\nLAUNCH-A04 Top content avoids the status bar (the logo and text are laid out centered/at the bottom and are not covered by the status bar)\nLAUNCH-A05 After the splash page has shown for about 1.2 seconds it navigates away automatically, with no user action needed\nLAUNCH-A06 When the local storage key `guide_shown` is not true (first install), the splash page goes to the guide page; otherwise it goes straight to the main page (MainRoutes.Main)\nLAUNCH-A07 When the splash page navigates away it removes itself from the back stack; pressing back on the guide/main page does not return to the splash page\nLAUNCH-A08 When the splash page goes to the main page, the logo moves via a shared element (key `app_logo`) to the logo position at the top of the home page\nLAUNCH-A09 The guide page has 4 horizontally swipeable pages; each shows an illustration, a bold title, and a multi-line description (`青商城 - 开源电商学习项目`, `声明式 UI 新体验`, `完整电商业务流程`, `模块化架构设计`)\nLAUNCH-A10 Top content avoids the status bar (the top-right `跳过` button sits inside the Scaffold safe area and is not covered by the status bar)\nLAUNCH-A11 The bottom has a page indicator with 4 dots; the dot for the current page is shown highlighted, elongated and opaque, and it updates in sync as the user swipes\nLAUNCH-A12 On pages that are not the last one, the bottom button says `继续`; tapping it scrolls to the next page with animation\nLAUNCH-A13 On the last page the bottom button text becomes `开始体验` (and the button gets wider)\nLAUNCH-A14 In the normal flow (fromSettings=false), tapping `开始体验` or `跳过` writes local storage `guide_shown`=true and then goes to the main page, removing the guide page from the back stack\nLAUNCH-A15 After finishing the guide, the next cold start skips the guide page (splash → main page)\nLAUNCH-A16 When opened from the settings page's `应用引导` entry (fromSettings=true), tapping `开始体验` or `跳过` only goes back to the previous page (settings); it does not write `guide_shown` and does not go to the main page\nLAUNCH-A17 The guide page follows light/dark mode (surface background), and the indicator/button colors follow the current theme primary color",
