      "expectation": "MAIN-A11 The Cart page title is `购物车`; the back arrow shows only when opened standalone with showBackIcon=true (e.g. from the goods detail page's cart entry), and tapping it goes back; on the tab page there is no back arrow\nMAIN-A12 Cart data comes from the local database (Room table carts, not tied to the account, no network) and is observed live; any add/remove/count change refreshes the list automatically\nMAIN-A13 When the cart is empty, it shows the empty state `购物车是空的`/`快去添加商品吧` (no button) and hides both the top-right edit button and the bottom checkout bar\nMAIN-A14 When the cart has items, each goods entry is a card grouped by goods (name/image) listing each spec row: select box, spec name, price (¥ + integer + .00), quantity stepper; tapping the goods card goes to that goods' detail page\nMAIN-A15 The select box on each spec row toggles that spec's selected state independently (selection is by goodsId+specId)\nMAIN-A16 The quantity stepper changes count by ±1 with a minimum of 1 (minus disabled at 1, no stock cap); the change is written to the local database right away\nMAIN-A17 The bottom bar has a `全选` select box: it shows checked when every spec is selected; tapping it when all are selected clears the selection, otherwise it selects every spec\nMAIN-A18 In normal mode the bottom bar shows `合计:` + the selected total (Σ price×count of selected specs) and a checkout button: `结算` when nothing is selected (disabled), `结算(%d)` (with the selected spec count) when specs are selected\nMAIN-A19 The top-right `编辑` button enters edit mode and changes to `完成`; entering or leaving edit mode clears the current selection; in edit mode the bottom bar replaces total/checkout with a red `删除`/`删除(%d)` button (disabled when nothing is selected)\nMAIN-A20 Tapping delete plays a slide-out animation and then deletes the selected specs: when all specs of a goods are selected the whole goods is deleted, otherwise only the selected specs; a goods whose last spec is removed is deleted too; after deletion the selection is cleared and edit mode ends\nMAIN-A21 On checkout, it toasts `请选择要结算的商品` when nothing is selected; otherwise it writes the selected cart items (selected specs only) to MMKV key `carts`, writes them converted into a SelectedGoods list to MMKV key `selectedGoodsList`, then goes to the confirm-order page (OrderRoutes.Confirm)\nMAIN-A22 When not logged in, tapping checkout goes to the login page instead of the confirm-order page (Confirm is a login-required route)",
