      "expectation": "MAIN-A23 The Me page user area: when logged in it shows avatar, nickname and `手机号` + phone number; when not logged in it shows the default avatar, `未登录` and `点击登录账号`; tapping the area goes to the profile page (when not logged in, to the login page)\nMAIN-A24 On entering the Me page, if logged in but with no cached user info, it fetches user info; on every page resume (onResume) it requests order counts when logged in (GET order/info/userCount) and resets all counts to 0 when not logged in\nMAIN-A25 The Me page shows a member card `会员立享5大权益!` + `立即开通` (display only, no tap behavior)\nMAIN-A26 The order area title `我的订单` + `查看全部` goes to the all-orders list; the five entries `待付款`/`待发货`/`待收货`/`待评价`/`退款/售后` go to the order list with tab=1/2/3/5/4; each entry with count>0 shows a red badge (退款/售后 = 退款中 + 已退款); when not logged in, every order entry goes to the login page\nMAIN-A27 When local footprints exist, it shows the `我的足迹` area: `查看全部` goes to the footprint page, below it a horizontal list of up to 8 most recent footprint images (by browse time, newest first), tapping one goes to goods detail; when there are no footprints the area is hidden\nMAIN-A28 The function menu has, in order, `优惠券`→coupon page, `收货地址`→address list, `在线客服`→customer-service chat, `意见反馈`→feedback list, `关于我们`→about page; a separate card holds `设置`→settings page; coupon/address/chat/feedback go to the login page when not logged in",
