      "expectation": "HOME-A01 The main shell has a bottom navigation bar with 4 tabs in a fixed order: `主页`, `分类`, `购物车`, `我的`; the Home tab is selected by default at startup\nHOME-A02 Tapping a bottom tab switches to that tab's page, and the selected tab's label shows in the primary color while unselected labels are dimmed\nHOME-A03 The four tab pages can also be switched by swiping left or right (horizontal pager), and the selected bottom tab stays in sync with the page swiped to\nHOME-A04 The selected tab icon plays its animation once (Lottie: home/category/cart/me), and unselected icons stay on the first frame\nHOME-A05 The home top content avoids the status bar (TopAppBar handles the status bar inset; the bottom bar avoids the navigation bar)\nHOME-A06 The home top bar has the app logo on the left (tapping opens the About page), a search box in the middle with the placeholder `搜索商品` (tapping opens the goods search page), and a GitHub icon on the right (tapping opens a built-in web page with the title `GitHub` loading https://github.com/Joker-x-dev/CoolMallKotlin)\nHOME-A07 The home top bar collapses as the content scrolls up and reappears on scroll down (enterAlways)\nHOME-A08 During the first load the home page shows a dedicated skeleton screen (banner/coupon/category/flash sale/title/recommended placeholders) instead of a generic loader, and it stays at least 320ms\nHOME-A09 When the home page opens it requests the home aggregate API (GET page/home), and the response fills the banner, coupon, category, flash sale, recommended goods and first page of all goods all at once\nHOME-A10 When the home data fails to load, the page shows the network error state `网络连接失败`/`请检查网络连接后重试`, and tapping `重新加载` requests the home data again\nHOME-A11 The banner carousel shows the banner images at a 2:1 ratio, autoplays every 3 seconds in a loop with page indicators, and banners do not respond to taps\nHOME-A12 When there are coupons, the coupon bar shows coupon titles you can swipe through (no autoplay, no indicator), with a `领取` link on the right; tapping it opens the `领取优惠券` bottom sheet listing all home coupons\nHOME-A13 Tapping receive on a coupon in the sheet: when not logged in, the sheet closes and the app goes to the login page; when logged in, it calls POST market/coupon/user/receive (couponId), and on success shows the success toast message returned by the server\nHOME-A14 The category area shows categories in a grid of 5 per row (round image + name), with blank space filling any incomplete row\nHOME-A15 Tapping a home category goes to the goods category list page, passing as typeId the comma-joined IDs of all child categories in categoryAll whose parentId equals that category\nHOME-A16 The flash sale card has the title `限时精选` with a `查看全部` entry on the right (tapping opens the goods category list with featured=true), and below it a horizontally scrolling list of goods (image/one-line title/price); tapping a good opens its detail page\nHOME-A17 When home goods data exists, it shows a `推荐商品` section title followed by the recommended goods as a vertical list (horizontal list rows), and tapping one opens goods detail\nHOME-A18 Under the `全部商品` section title, all goods show as a two-column staggered grid, and tapping a good opens goods detail\nHOME-A19 Scrolling to within 3 items of the end of the grid triggers load more: it requests POST goods/info/page (page starting at 2, size=10) and appends the results to the all goods list; when there is no next page it shows `没有更多了`, and on failure it shows a tap-to-retry state and rolls back the page number\nHOME-A20 Pull-to-refresh resets the page number to 1 and requests page/home again, replacing all the home section data and the all goods list; refresh is ignored while a load is in progress\nHOME-A21 Home sections are shown conditionally: when banner/coupon/category/flashSale/goods in the home data is null, that section (or its section title) is not shown",
