      "expectation": "GOODS-A01 When the detail page opens, it requests the product detail by goodsId (goodsInfo + coupon list + comment list); while loading it shows the detail skeleton screen, and on failure it shows the network error state with a retry button that requests again\nGOODS-A02 When the detail loads successfully, it shows from top to bottom: the image carousel (no autoplay), the price (the selected spec's price if a spec is selected, otherwise the product price) with the sold tag `已售 %d`, the title, the subtitle, and the spec selection row\nGOODS-A03 When the detail returns a non-empty coupon list, coupon tags `满%d减%d元` are shown below the price; tapping any tag opens the coupon bottom sheet `领取优惠券`\nGOODS-A04 Tapping claim in the coupon sheet: when not logged in, it closes the sheet and goes to the login page; when logged in, it calls the claim-coupon API with couponId and shows a success toast with the returned text\nGOODS-A05 The spec row shows `选择规格` when no spec is selected and `已选：%s` (the spec name) when one is; tapping it opens the spec selection bottom sheet titled `选择规格`\nGOODS-A06 The spec list is requested by goodsId only after the spec sheet has fully expanded; once loaded successfully it is not requested again, and inside the sheet loading shows a loading indicator while failure shows the network error state with retry\nGOODS-A07 In the spec sheet, tapping a spec selects it and tapping the selected spec again deselects it; the header shows `¥` price, `已选`/`未选择`, and `库存`; the spec area can switch between grid and list views\nGOODS-A08 The `数量` stepper in the spec sheet appears only after a spec is selected; quantity defaults to 1 and cannot go below 1\nGOODS-A09 The sheet's `加入购物车` and `立即购买` buttons are enabled only when a spec is selected and its stock is > 0; otherwise they are disabled\nGOODS-A10 Add to cart writes to the local cart (no login check): if the same product and spec already exist, the quantity adds up; same product with a new spec appends that spec; otherwise a new cart entry is created; on success the sheet closes and `添加购物车成功` is shown, and invalid parameters show `添加购物车失败`\nGOODS-A11 Buy now writes [SelectedGoods(goodsId, goodsInfo, spec, count)] into local storage key `selectedGoodsList`, closes the spec sheet, and goes to the order confirm page\nGOODS-A12 Bottom action bar of the detail page: `客服` goes to the support chat page, `购物车` goes to the cart page (with a back button), and both `加入购物车` and `立即购买` open the spec selection sheet\nGOODS-A13 The detail page shows the `发货与服务` card: `发货` `云南省 昆明市`, `服务` `7天无理由退货 · 运费险 · 48小时发货`\nGOODS-A14 Only when the detail has comments does it show the `商品评价` card (right side `查看全部`); each comment shows the nickname (`匿名用户` when empty), star rating, content, and first image with a `+N` count badge; tapping the title or any comment goes to that product's comment page\nGOODS-A15 At the bottom of the detail page, the `商品详情` section shows all rich-text detail images in order\nGOODS-A16 The detail page has a floating top bar (back button returns to the previous page; the share button does nothing); the top bar background goes from transparent to opaque as the page scrolls (white in light mode, black in dark mode)\nGOODS-A17 Detail page: top content avoids the status bar (the carousel extends under the status bar, and the floating top bar buttons avoid it)\nGOODS-A18 After the detail loads successfully, a browsing footprint is written locally (goodsId as unique key, with name/subtitle/main image/price/sold count/browse time); a failed write does not affect the page\nGOODS-A19 The comment page title is `商品评论` with a back button; while loading it shows the comment skeleton screen, with no data it shows the empty state, and on failure it shows the network error state with retry\nGOODS-A20 The comment page requests comment pages by goodsId (10 per page) and supports pull-to-refresh and load-more near the bottom; when every page has loaded it shows no more data\nGOODS-A21 Each comment card shows the nickname (`匿名用户` when empty), comment time, 5-star rating, content (when non-empty), and an image grid (at most 9 images, 3 per row)\nGOODS-A22 Comment page: top content avoids the status bar",
