      "expectation": "GOODS-A23 When the search page opens, it requests the recommended search keyword list and also subscribes to the 10 most recent local search history entries (newest first; the list refreshes as soon as it changes)\nGOODS-A24 The search page top bar has a back button, an input box (placeholder `输入内容进行搜索`), and a `搜索` button (keyboard search also submits); below it, `搜索历史` is shown only when history exists (a delete icon on the right clears all history), followed by the `推荐搜索` tags\nGOODS-A25 Submitting a non-blank keyword (input box / history tag / recommended tag) first writes search history (trimmed, deduplicated by keyword with the time refreshed), then goes to the category product list carrying that keyword; a blank keyword does nothing\nGOODS-A26 Search page: top content avoids the status bar\nGOODS-A27 The category product list reads route parameters: typeId (comma-separated category ids, preselected as filters), featured, recommend, keyword (also pre-filled in the search box), and minPrice (pre-filled as the minimum price when arriving from a coupon)\nGOODS-A28 The product list requests by page (10 per page) with: category ids, min/max price, keyword, sort field (sold/price) and direction (asc/desc), recommend, featured; empty conditions are not sent\nGOODS-A29 The sort bar has `综合`, `销量`, and `价格`: tapping `综合` clears sorting; first tap on `销量`/`价格` sorts ascending, tapping again sorts descending, and a third tap goes back to `综合`; the up/down arrows highlight the current direction, and every sort change refreshes the list from page 1\nGOODS-A30 Tapping `筛选` opens the filter overlay; on first open only, the category list is requested and built into a parent-child tree (sorted by sortNum, nested by parentId); the overlay shows loading while the request is in progress and the network error state on failure\nGOODS-A31 The filter overlay has the title `筛选` and a close button, a `价格区间` row with numeric inputs `最低价`/`最高价`, and one card per top-level category whose child categories are multi-select chips (icon + name); `重置` clears the conditions and refreshes the list (the overlay stays open), `确定` applies the conditions, closes the overlay and refreshes the list, and tapping the mask closes it without applying\nGOODS-A32 The category page defaults to a two-column grid; the button at the right of the top bar toggles grid/list, and when the top bar collapses on scroll, the toggle button appears at the right end of the sort bar\nGOODS-A33 The category page shows a skeleton screen while loading, the empty state with no data, and the network error state with retry on failure; the list supports pull-to-refresh and load-more, and tapping a product goes to its detail page\nGOODS-A34 Submitting from the category page's own search box re-queries the list with the new keyword (no keyword condition when empty) and does not write search history\nGOODS-A35 Category product list page: top content avoids the status bar",
