      "expectation": "ORDA-A01 On all three pages (order list, order detail, logistics), the top content avoids the status bar (edge-to-edge; the AppScaffold top bar takes the status bar inset)\nORDA-A02 Order list, order detail and logistics all require login: when not logged in, navigating to any of these three routes is redirected to the login page\nORDA-A03 The order list page title is `订单列表`, and the top bar has a back button that returns to the previous page\nORDA-A04 The order list has a horizontally scrollable status tab bar with 7 tabs in this order: `全部` `待付款` `待发货` `待收货` `售后/退款` `待评价` `已完成`; the selected tab is highlighted\nORDA-A05 Tapping a tab scrolls the pager to that page with animation; swiping the pager left or right also switches the selected tab, and the two stay in sync\nORDA-A06 Route parameter tab (string \"0\"–\"6\") picks the initial tab; out of range or not a number falls back to `全部` (index 0). The Me page entries pass 1=待付款, 2=待发货, 3=待收货, 4=售后, 5=待评价\nORDA-A07 Each tab requests order/info/page (POST, body page/size=10/status) with these status filters: 全部=no status, 待付款=[0], 待发货=[1], 待收货=[2], 售后/退款=[5,6], 待评价=[3], 已完成=[4]\nORDA-A08 Each tab has its own list, page number, loading state, refresh state and load-more state. A tab requests page 1 only on its first selection (lazy loading); switching back to a loaded tab does not request again\nORDA-A09 The first load of each tab shows the order list skeleton screen; an empty result shows the empty-data state; a failed first load (list still empty) shows the network-error state, and tapping retry requests page 1 again\nORDA-A10 Pull-to-refresh requests page 1 again and replaces that tab's list (skipped while a load is in progress); on refresh failure with an existing list, the old data is kept and the error state is not shown\nORDA-A11 Scrolling to within the last 3 items triggers load-more (page number +1) and appends the results to the end of the list. No next page (pagination.size*page >= total) shows \"no more\"; on load-more failure, the page number rolls back and an error state is shown so the user can trigger it again\nORDA-A12 Each order card shows the order number orderNum and, on the right, the status text (0 `待付款`, 1 `待发货`, 2 `待收货`, 3 `待评价`, 4 `交易完成`, 5 `退款中`, 6 `已退款`, 7 `已关闭`, other `未知状态`); tapping the card goes to that order's detail page\nORDA-A13 The order card scrolls the goods images horizontally (spec image first, then goods main image), with the order total price on the right (`¥` integer `.00`) and `共 N 件` (N = number of goodsList rows)\nORDA-A14 The order action buttons depend on status: 0 shows `取消订单` + `去支付`; 1/2 show `售后/退款`; 2 shows `确认收货`; 2/3/4/5/6 show `查看物流`; 3/4 show `去评价`; every status except 0 and 2 shows `再次购买` (status 7 shows only `再次购买`). List cards and the detail page bottom bar use the same rules\nORDA-A15 `去支付` goes to the cashier page OrderRoutes.Pay with the amount = price - discountPrice; `售后/退款` goes to the refund request page; `查看物流` goes to the logistics page\nORDA-A16 `取消订单` opens the `选择取消原因` bottom sheet: once fully expanded it loads the cancellation-reason dictionary (shows loading; on failure shows network error with retry; no reload after success). It is single-choice, and `确认` is disabled until a reason is selected\nORDA-A17 The cancellation reason comes from dict/info/data (POST types=[\"orderCancelReason\"]). Confirming calls order/info/cancel (POST orderId, remark=the selected reason's name) and closes the sheet; on success the list refreshes the `全部` `待付款` `待发货` tabs (the current tab reloads immediately; the others reload when next selected)\nORDA-A18 `确认收货` opens a dialog with title `确认收货`, content `确认收货后无法发起退款等售后申请，请谨慎操作`, and buttons `确认` / `取消`; cancel or tapping outside closes it\nORDA-A19 Confirm receipt calls order/info/confirm (GET orderId). On success the dialog closes and the list refreshes the `全部` `待收货` `待评价` tabs; on failure an error toast is shown\nORDA-A20 `再次购买`: when the order has more than one distinct goods item (grouped by goodsId), the `选择要购买的商品` bottom sheet opens and each row's `再次购买` button goes to that goods detail page; with one goods item it goes straight to goods detail\nORDA-A21 `去评价`: with more than one distinct goods item, the `选择要评价的商品` bottom sheet opens and each row's `去评价` button goes to OrderRoutes.Comment(orderId, goodsId); with one goods item it goes straight to the comment page\nORDA-A22 When the order list receives a RefreshResult(refresh=true) passed back from a child page (detail/pay/refund/comment), it resets all 7 tabs and reloads the current tab immediately",
