      "expectation": "ORDA-A23 The order detail page requests order/info/info (GET id=orderId) on entry; the loading state shows the order detail skeleton screen (at least 320ms), and on failure shows network error with retry\nORDA-A24 The order detail large top bar title shows `订单详情` before loading, and after success switches by status to `待付款` `待发货` `待收货` `待评价` `交易完成` `退款中` `已退款` `已关闭`\nORDA-A25 The order detail page shows, from top to bottom: the shipping address card, the goods cards (grouped by goods, specs listed, no quantity stepper), and the `价格明细` card (`商品总价`=price, `优惠金额`=discountPrice with the coupon title as description, `实付金额`=price-discountPrice)\nORDA-A26 When the order has refund information, the detail page shows the `退款信息` card: `退款金额`, `退款状态` (0 `申请中` / 1 `已退款` / 2 `拒绝退款` / other `未知状态`), and `申请原因`; when the status is 2 it shows `拒绝原因`, otherwise `申请时间`, with empty values shown as `无`\nORDA-A27 The detail page `订单信息` card shows `订单编号` (orderNum + `复制` link), `支付方式` (always `微信`), `支付时间` (shows `未支付` when payTime is empty), `下单时间` and `订单备注` (shows `无` when empty)\nORDA-A28 After the order detail loads successfully, a bottom bar shows the action buttons by status (same rules as ORDA-A14); cancel order / confirm receipt / rebuy / comment use the same sheets and dialogs as the list page (the multi-goods sheet uses the current order's goods)\nORDA-A29 After cancelling the order or confirming receipt successfully on the detail page, the order detail is fetched again and the page is marked to refresh the list on back\nORDA-A30 The detail page listens for a RefreshResult passed back from child pages such as pay: when it arrives, the detail is fetched again and marked to refresh the list on back. Both the top bar back and the system back go through the same logic: when marked, it returns to the previous page with RefreshResult(refresh=true); otherwise it simply goes back\nORDA-A31 The logistics page large top bar title is `物流详情`. On entry it shows the logistics skeleton screen; on failure to fetch the order info it shows network error with retry\nORDA-A32 On entry the logistics page requests order/info/info (GET id) and order/info/logistics (GET orderId) in parallel; a failed logistics request shows only an error toast, and the logistics section shows defaults\nORDA-A33 The logistics page shows the shipping address card, then the `物流信息` card (express logo, `快递公司` shows `未知快递` when expName is empty, `物流编号` + `复制`, `快递员`, `联系电话` + `拨打`, `运输耗时`)\nORDA-A34 The logistics page `物流轨迹` card shows a vertical step timeline in list order. Each node shows the status text and time; the first node is highlighted (active color, larger dot, medium weight), and nodes are joined by lines except after the last one\nORDA-A35 All three pages support dark mode (preview AppTheme(darkTheme=true)), with colors following the theme",
