      "expectation": "ORDB-A01 On all four pages (Confirm/Pay/Refund/Comment) the top content (large title bar) avoids the status bar\nORDB-A02 Confirm, Pay, Refund, and Comment are all login-required routes: when not logged in, navigating to them goes to the login page instead\nORDB-A03 The confirm order page title is `确认订单`; while loading it shows the confirm-order skeleton, and on load failure it shows the network-error empty state, where tapping retry requests again\nORDB-A04 On entry the confirm order page requests page/confirmOrder to get the default address (defaultAddress) and the user's coupons (userCoupon)\nORDB-A05 The confirm page's item list is read first from local cache key `carts` (from the cart), otherwise from `selectedGoodsList` (buy now from goods detail, grouped by goodsId and converted to an item card with multiple specs); both cache keys are deleted immediately after reading\nORDB-A06 The address card on the confirm page shows the default address (with none it shows `您还没有选择收货地址`/`点击添加收货地址`); tapping it opens the address list in select mode, and the address chosen there and passed back replaces the current page's address\nORDB-A07 The confirm page shows one goods card (spec/count, no quantity stepper) per item, plus a `价格明细` card: `商品总价`, `优惠券` (shows the selected coupon title, `选择` when none), `合计`; the `优惠券折扣` row (negative value) shows only when the discount is >0\nORDB-A08 Item total = sum over all specs of price×count; with a coupon selected, the discount equals the coupon amount only when the total ≥ the coupon's condition.fullAmount, otherwise 0 (also 0 when the coupon has no condition); total = total − discount, with a floor of 0\nORDB-A09 Tapping the `优惠券` row opens the `选择优惠券` bottom sheet listing userCoupon; a card whose threshold is not met by the current item total shows `不满足条件`, used/expired cards show `已使用`/`已过期`, the selected one shows `已选择`, and a selectable one shows a `选择` button; selecting closes the sheet and recalculates prices\nORDB-A10 The confirm page has an `订单备注` input (label `订单备注`, placeholder `选填，付款后商家可见`, multi-line), and its content is submitted as the order remark\nORDB-A11 Only after loading succeeds does the confirm page bottom bar show, with the total price and a `提交订单` button\nORDB-A12 When submitting the order with no address, toast error `请选择收货地址` and do not submit; otherwise call order/info/create (addressId, goodsList=selectedGoodsList, title=`购买商品`, remark, couponId), and on failure toast the error message\nORDB-A13 After the order is created successfully, if the items came from the cart, remove the ordered items from the local cart (delete the whole item when all its specs were ordered, otherwise delete per spec)\nORDB-A14 After the order is created successfully, the confirm page closes and goes to the payment page, carrying orderId, amount = price − discountPrice, and from=confirm\nORDB-A15 The payment page title is `收银台`; the middle shows the amount `¥<price>.00` in large text, the payment method list `支付宝支付` (fixed selected), `微信支付`, `QQ支付` (unselected, not switchable), and the tip `提示：实际支付金额经过处理，都是一分钱`\nORDB-A16 The payment page bottom button shows `去支付 ¥<price>` when price>0, otherwise `去支付`\nORDB-A17 Tapping the pay button calls order/pay/alipayAppPay({orderId}) to get the Alipay orderString, and on failure toasts the error\nORDB-A18 After getting the orderString, the Alipay App/H5 payment is actually launched (Android PayTask.payV2, run off the main thread), and when it returns the resultStatus is parsed\nORDB-A19 Payment result mapping: resultStatus `9000` → toast `支付成功`; `6001` → toast `支付已取消`; anything else → toast `支付失败`\nORDB-A20 After payment ends or on back (title-bar back and system back are both intercepted): if from=confirm, always return and open the order detail page for that order; otherwise on success return to the previous page with a refresh signal (RefreshResult refresh=true), and on failure/cancel/back just return",
