      "expectation": "ORDB-A21 The refund page title is `退款申请`; on entry it requests order/info/info?id=orderId, showing loading/error retry states; on success it shows the `退款信息` card (`申请原因` row shows the selected reason or `请选择`, `退款金额` shows the order realPrice) and the order's goods cards (grouped by goods)\nORDB-A22 Tapping `申请原因` opens a bottom sheet titled `选择取消原因`; after it expands it loads the dictionary dict/info/data (types=[orderRefundReason]) (not reloaded once loaded); during loading it shows loading, on failure the network-error empty state can retry, and after choosing a reason, tapping `确定` writes back the selected reason and closes the sheet\nORDB-A23 The refund page bottom `提交` button is shown only after the order loads successfully, and stays disabled until a reason is selected\nORDB-A24 Submitting the refund calls order/info/refund (orderId, reason=reason name); on success it returns to the previous page with a refresh signal\nORDB-A25 The comment page title is `商品评价`; it shows a 5-star rating (default 5 stars) with the rating text below `很差`/`较差`/`一般`/`满意`/`非常满意` (0 stars shows `请点击星星进行评分`), the content input (placeholder `请输入您的评价内容...`), and an image grid picker of at most 9 images\nORDB-A26 The comment page bottom `提交评价` button is disabled when the rating is 0 or the content is blank; while submitting it shows loading and is disabled; a repeat tap toasts `正在提交中...`, and failed validation toasts `请先填写评价内容和评分`\nORDB-A27 When submitting the comment with images, first get upload credentials and batch-upload them to Tencent Cloud COS to get a URL list, then call goods/comment/submit (orderId, data={orderId, goodsId, content, starCount, pics}; pics=null when there are no images); if the image upload fails, no comment is submitted and the submitting state ends\nORDB-A28 After the comment is submitted successfully it toasts `评价提交成功` and returns to the previous page with a refresh signal\nORDB-A29 Adding an image on the comment page launches the system photo picker (images only), and once selected the thumbnails show in the grid and can be removed\nORDB-A30 All four pages support dark mode (Light/Dark previews in the source; the theme follows the system/app setting)",
