      ],
      "expectation": "AUTH-A01 On all five auth pages, top content (back button bar / title) avoids the status bar (edge-to-edge app; page uses AppScaffold with a back button that returns to the previous page)\nAUTH-A02 The login method selection page shows the app logo, primary button `验证码登录` (goes to SMS login) and outlined button `账号密码登录` (goes to account login)\nAUTH-A03 The login method selection page shows the `其他登录方式` heading and three third-party entries `微信`, `QQ`, `支付宝` (icon + name)\nAUTH-A04 Tapping `微信` or `支付宝` on the selection page only shows the warning toast `三方登录暂时仅支持QQ登录` and does not log in\nAUTH-A05 Tapping `QQ` starts the QQ SDK authorization; on success it calls the QQ login API with accessToken+openId, and when the user cancels it shows the warning toast `登录取消`; when it fails it shows an error toast starting with `登录失败`; when launching throws it shows `启动QQ登录失败`\nAUTH-A06 After QQ login succeeds, it shows the success toast `登录成功`, persists Auth, sets the logged-in state, refreshes user info, and pops back once (leaves the login selection page)\nAUTH-A07 The selection page, account login, and SMS login pages show the user agreement line `登录即代表您已阅读并同意` + `《用户协议》` + `和` + `《隐私政策》`; tapping either link opens the user agreement / privacy policy page respectively (register page prefix is `注册即代表您已阅读并同意`)\nAUTH-A08 Account login, SMS login, and register pages show the two-line title `你好，` + `欢迎登录青商城` / `欢迎注册青商城`; the reset password page title is `重置密码`\nAUTH-A09 The phone input field shows the `+86` prefix and the placeholder `请输入手机号`; the password field placeholder is `请输入密码` and it is masked by default; tapping the eye icon toggles show/hide password\nAUTH-A10 Phone validation rule: exactly 11 digits matching ^1[3-9]\\d{9}$; SMS code: exactly 4 digits; password: at least 6 characters (no other strength rules)\nAUTH-A11 The account login page `登录` button is disabled until the phone is valid and the password is at least 6 characters\nAUTH-A12 Account login submits phone+password to POST user/login/password; when the phone is invalid it shows the toast `请输入正确的手机号`, and when the password is invalid it shows `请输入正确的密码` without sending a request\nAUTH-A13 After account login succeeds, it saves the phone and password locally (MMKV keys saved_phone / saved_password), shows `登录成功`, persists Auth and sets the logged-in state, refreshes user info, then pops back twice (back past the selection page to the page before login)\nAUTH-A14 When the account login page opens, it prefills the phone number and password saved from the last successful login\nAUTH-A15 The account login page bottom has `去注册` | `忘记密码`; tapping them goes to the register page / reset password page respectively\nAUTH-A16 The SMS code input accepts digits only and at most 4 characters; the `获取验证码` text on its right is clickable only when the phone is valid (greyed and not clickable otherwise); there is no countdown after sending\nAUTH-A17 On the SMS login and register pages, tapping `获取验证码` first requests notification permission; when denied it shows the toast `需要通知权限才能接收验证码` and does not continue\nAUTH-A18 After permission is granted and the phone is valid, it calls GET user/login/captcha to fetch the image captcha (captchaId + base64 image) and then opens the image captcha dialog; when the phone is invalid it shows `请输入正确的手机号`\nAUTH-A19 The image captcha dialog (bottom sheet) has title `安全验证`, input placeholder `请输入图形验证码` (digits only, at most 4), the captcha image on the right, and button `完成验证` which is enabled only when 4 characters are entered\nAUTH-A20 Tapping the captcha image fetches a new captcha; when the image is empty or fails to decode, it shows a `点击刷新` placeholder that refreshes when tapped\nAUTH-A21 After tapping `完成验证`, the dialog closes and clears the image captcha input, and it calls POST user/login/smsCode with phone, captchaId, code (image captcha)\nAUTH-A22 After the SMS code API succeeds, the returned code is shown as a high-priority system notification titled `验证码` with content `您的验证码是: <code>` (the demo backend returns the code directly instead of sending a real SMS)\nAUTH-A23 The SMS login `登录` button is enabled only when the phone is valid and the code is 4 digits; tapping it calls POST user/login/phone (phone, smsCode); an invalid code shows the toast `请输入4位验证码`\nAUTH-A24 After SMS login succeeds, it saves the phone (saved_phone), shows `登录成功`, persists Auth/logged-in state, refreshes user info, and pops back twice; on next entry to SMS login the phone is prefilled\nAUTH-A25 The SMS login page bottom shows `短信不可用？` with `使用三方登录`; tapping the latter returns to the login method selection page\nAUTH-A31 All login/register success paths persist Auth{token, refreshToken, expire, refreshExpire, createdAt} as JSON under the local key auth_info and set isLoggedIn=true; logged-in means auth_info exists, token is non-empty, and it is not past createdAt+expire seconds\nAUTH-A33 After a successful login, the app is still logged in after a cold restart (state restored from auth_info at startup)\nAUTH-A34 When an auth API returns an unsuccessful business response or a network error, it shows the backend message (or `网络请求失败`) as an error toast and stays on the current page",
