      "expectation": "AUTH-A26 The register page has, in order: phone, code (with `获取验证码`), `请设置密码`, `请确认密码`, the register agreement line, and the `注册` button; the bottom has `已有账号？` `去登录` (tapping goes back)\nAUTH-A27 The `注册` button is enabled only when the phone is valid, the code is 4 digits, the password is at least 6 characters, and both passwords match; on submit it validates in order and shows `请输入正确的手机号`/`请输入4位验证码`/`请输入正确的密码`/`两次输入的密码不一致`, then calls POST user/login/register (phone, smsCode, password, confirmPassword)\nAUTH-A28 After registration succeeds, it shows the success toast `注册成功`, persists Auth and sets the logged-in state, refreshes user info, and pops back once (back to the account login page)\nAUTH-A29 The reset password page shows phone, code, `请设置新密码`, `请确认新密码`, and the hint `重置密码后，请使用新密码登录`; when both passwords are non-empty and differ it shows the red hint `两次输入的密码不一致`\nAUTH-A30 The reset password page `重置密码` button is always disabled, and its `获取验证码` makes no request (both are empty stub implementations in the source)",
