      "expectation": "USER-A01 Profile, AddressList, AddressDetail, Coupon, FeedbackList and FeedbackSubmit all require login: when not logged in, navigating to them is intercepted and goes to the login page; Footprint is NOT in the login list and opens directly\nUSER-A02 Profile page (title `个人中心`) top content avoids the status bar\nUSER-A03 The Profile page shows the `头像` row (current user's avatar) and the `昵称` row (nickname, `未设置` when empty); both are read-only rows with no edit entry\nUSER-A04 Under `账号信息`, Profile shows `手机号` (`未绑定` when empty) and `账号` (user id, `未设置` when empty)\nUSER-A05 Under `社交账号`, Profile shows static rows `微信`→`去绑定` and `QQ`→`已绑定`; under `安全`, it shows arrowed rows `修改密码` and `注销账户` that have no click behavior\nUSER-A06 Tapping `退出登录` on Profile clears the local token and user info, sets the global login state to logged-out, and returns to the previous page (no server logout call)\nUSER-A07 When Profile opens logged in but with no cached user info, it refreshes the user info once\nUSER-A25 Footprint page (title `我的足迹`) top content avoids the status bar\nUSER-A26 Footprint shows browsed goods in a two-column staggered grid (image/title/price/sold count); tapping one opens goods detail; with no records it shows the empty state `暂无数据`\nUSER-A27 When there are footprints, the top bar shows `清空 (%d)` (total count); tapping it clears all footprints with no confirmation and the page switches to the empty state\nUSER-A28 Footprints are stored in the local database table footprints with goodsId as the primary key (REPLACE on revisit, refreshing viewTime), sorted by viewTime descending, and written each time goods detail opens\nUSER-A29 Footprint records are still there after a cold app restart and are not cleared on logout",
