      "expectation": "USER-A08 AddressList page (title `收货地址`) top content avoids the status bar\nUSER-A09 On first load AddressList shows a 3-card skeleton; on load failure it shows the error state with retry; with no data it shows the empty state `暂无数据`\nUSER-A10 AddressList calls user/address/page with paging (page/size=10), and supports pull-to-refresh and load-more (`没有更多了` when no more pages)\nUSER-A11 Each address card shows contact, phone, province+city+district, and the detailed address; the default address shows a `默认` tag, and the card has edit and delete icon buttons\nUSER-A12 The AddressList bottom `新增地址` button (hidden while loading/on error) opens AddressDetail in add mode; tapping a card or its edit button opens AddressDetail in edit mode with that address id\nUSER-A13 Tapping the delete button shows the confirm dialog `删除地址`/`确认删除该地址吗？` with buttons `确认`/`取消`; cancel closes the dialog\nUSER-A14 After confirming delete, user/address/delete is called with {ids:[id]}; on success the list refreshes and the dialog closes\nUSER-A15 When AddressList is opened in select mode (isSelectMode=true, from order confirmation), tapping a card returns that address to the previous page (SelectAddressResultKey) and closes the list\nUSER-A16 When returning from AddressDetail with a refresh signal (RefreshResultKey refresh=true), AddressList refreshes automatically\nUSER-A17 AddressDetail page top content avoids the status bar; its title is `编辑地址` in edit mode and `添加地址` in add mode\nUSER-A18 In edit mode (addressId>0), AddressDetail calls user/address/info?id= and fills the form; on failure it shows error + retry; in add mode it shows an empty form directly\nUSER-A19 The AddressDetail form has inputs `联系人` (`请填写联系人`), `手机号码` (`请填写手机号码`, phone keyboard), `省市区` (`请选择所在地区`, read-only, opens the region picker on tap), and `详细地址` (`街道、楼牌号等`, multi-line)\nUSER-A20 The AddressDetail `设置默认地址` row (description `下单会优先使用该地址`) has a switch that toggles the default flag\nUSER-A21 The bottom `保存` button (shown only after the form loads) calls user/address/update in edit mode and user/address/add in add mode (isDefault always serialized, no client validation); on success it returns to the list with a refresh signal\nUSER-A22 The region picker (title `请选择所在地区`) is a bottom sheet with three-level province/city/district tabs (unselected level shows `请选择`); picking a province auto-switches to city, then to district; picking a district closes it and fills `省 市 区`, and the selected item shows a check mark\nUSER-A23 Tapping the province tab in the region picker clears the selected city/district and goes back to the province list; when there is already a value, opening it restores the selection to the district level\nUSER-A24 Region data is a local static dataset of 13 provinces (Beijing/Tianjin/Hebei/Shanxi/Shanghai/Jiangsu/Zhejiang/Anhui/Guangdong/Guangxi/Sichuan/Guizhou/Shaanxi) → city → district, with no network request",
