      "expectation": "USER-A30 Coupon page (title `我的优惠券`) top content avoids the status bar\nUSER-A31 Coupon calls market/coupon/user/page with paging, with a 3-card skeleton on first load, plus error retry, empty state, pull-to-refresh, and load-more\nUSER-A32 A coupon card shows amount, `满%1$d元可用` threshold, title, `有效期至 %1$s`, and an expandable `使用说明`; useStatus=1 shows `已使用`, while useStatus=2 or endTime earlier than today shows `已过期`, otherwise it shows a `去使用` button\nUSER-A33 Tapping `去使用` opens the goods category page with the coupon's fullAmount threshold as minPrice\nUSER-A34 Coupon claiming (market/coupon/user/receive, {couponId}) happens on Home/GoodsDetail, not on this page: when not logged in it goes to the login page, and on success it toasts the server's returned text\nUSER-A35 FeedbackList page (title `反馈列表`) top content avoids the status bar\nUSER-A36 FeedbackList calls app/feedback/page with paging (skeleton/error retry/empty/pull-to-refresh/load-more), loads the feedbackType dictionary via dict/info/data to map the type name (`未知类型` when missing), and refreshes automatically after a successful submit\nUSER-A37 A feedback card shows a type tag, a status tag (status=1 `已处理`, otherwise `未处理`), creation time, and content; when there are images it shows a 3-column grid (up to 9); when remark is non-empty it shows a `客服回复` block\nUSER-A38 FeedbackList's bottom `我要反馈` button (hidden while loading/on error) opens the feedback submit page\nUSER-A39 FeedbackSubmit page (title `我要反馈`) top content avoids the status bar; on entry it loads the feedbackType dictionary, and on failure it shows error + retry\nUSER-A40 The FeedbackSubmit form has sections `反馈类型` (single-select chips from the dictionary), `反馈内容` (placeholder `请尽量详细描述遇到的问题，操作步骤，并附上相关页面截图，以便更好定位问题`), `联系方式（选填）` (placeholder `QQ/微信号，手机号，邮箱`), and `问题截图（选填）`\nUSER-A41 The screenshot area is a 3-column grid with up to 9 images: tapping the add cell opens the system image picker to pick one image appended to the list, each image can be removed, and the add cell is hidden once there are 9\nUSER-A42 The bottom `提交` button is disabled until a type is selected and content is non-empty, and shows loading while submitting; if somehow tapped with an invalid form it toasts `请选择反馈类型并填写反馈内容`, and a repeat tap while submitting toasts `正在提交中...`\nUSER-A43 When there are images, submitting first fetches upload credentials from base/comm/upload, uploads each image to Tencent COS (key app/base/<uuid>_image.<ext>) to get URLs, then calls app/feedback/submit {contact,type,content,images}; with no images it submits directly with images=null; if upload fails it only resets the submitting state and does not submit\nUSER-A44 After a successful submit it toasts `反馈提交成功，感谢您的反馈` and returns to the feedback list with a refresh signal",
