        "CS-A19",
        "CS-A20",
        "CS-A21"
      ],
      "expectation": "CS-A01 The chat page requires login: when not logged in, entering it from the goods-detail customer service button or the Me page entry goes to the login page instead\nCS-A02 The page has a centered top bar titled `客服聊天` with a back button that returns to the previous page; top content avoids the status bar\nCS-A03 During the first load, a chat skeleton screen is shown (day header + alternating left/right bubbles + input bar placeholder), and it stays for at least 320 ms\nCS-A04 On entry, the page first calls `cs/session/create` (POST) to create/get the session; on success it opens the WebSocket, loads page 1 of history, and marks unread messages as read; on failure it shows the shared network error view, and tapping retry recreates the session\nCS-A05 History is loaded through `cs/msg/page` (POST, body sessionId/page/size=10/order=createTime/sort=desc); a failed first-page load sets the page to the error state, and whether more pages exist is decided by pagination.size*page<total (or, without pagination, by whether this page has >=10 items)\nCS-A06 The message list shows newest at the bottom (descending data + reverse layout); scrolling up to the top automatically loads the next history page, which is appended with duplicates removed by id\nCS-A07 The history load-more item at the top of the list shows by state: `加载更多历史消息` / `正在加载历史消息...` (with a loading animation) / `加载成功` / `没有更多消息了`; on failure it shows `加载失败，点击重试`, which retries when tapped (a failure rolls back the page number)\nCS-A08 A message with type==0 (user) is right-aligned, uses the primary-color bubble, and has the user avatar on the right; type==1 (agent) is left-aligned, uses the gray bubble, and has the agent avatar on the left (adminUserHeadImg first, falling back to avatarUrl); above each bubble is a name (adminUserName first for the agent, falling back to nickName; nickName for the user)\nCS-A09 A message whose content.type is image (case-insensitive) shows as a network image (cropped square), and everything else shows as text content.data\nCS-A10 A time separator appears between two adjacent messages more than 10 minutes apart: same day shows `HH:mm`, otherwise `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm`; the newest message has no time header at the bottom\nCS-A11 When the list scrolls up more than 3 items, a `回到底部` tag appears at the bottom; tapping it animates the scroll back to the newest message\nCS-A12 The WebSocket connects to wss://mall.dusksnow.top/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=websocket (Socket.IO v4 protocol) and, once open, sends the auth frame 40/cs,{\"isAdmin\":false,\"token\":<token>}; it becomes connected on receiving a 40/cs, frame or 42/cs,[\"message\",\"连接成功\"]; it replies 3 to the heartbeat 2\nCS-A13 Received 42[\"msg\",{...}] or 42/cs,[\"msg\",{...}] frames are parsed as CsMsg and inserted at the newest position (ignored if the id already exists), and the list automatically scrolls to the newest message\nCS-A14 Sending a message: blank text is not sent; when not connected it only triggers a reconnect and does not send; when connected it sends 42/cs,[\"send\",{\"sessionId\":..,\"content\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"data\":..}}], and on success clears the input box; the sent message is not inserted locally, it appears only through the server's msg push\nCS-A15 After a successful send, the `send` sound plays; on receiving an agent reply (type==1) the `receive` sound plays (notification-type audio stream)\nCS-A16 Leaving the page (ViewModel destroyed) closes the WebSocket normally (code 1000) and releases the sound resources\nCS-A17 The bottom input bar: a single-line input box with placeholder `发送消息...`, an emoji button, and on the right, when there is input, a `发送` button, otherwise a more-functions plus button\nCS-A18 Tapping the emoji button hides the keyboard and expands the emoji panel (8-column grid, mutually exclusive with the function panel); tapping an emoji appends it to the end of the input; tapping it again collapses the panel; focusing the input box closes both panels\nCS-A19 Tapping the plus button expands the function panel with two items, `相册` and `拍摄`; tapping either only collapses the panel (the source has a TODO and does not implement picking/sending an image)\nCS-A20 When the keyboard opens, the input area rises with it and the message list stays visible above it; the bottom avoids the navigation bar\nCS-A21 The page supports dark mode: bubbles/input box/panels use theme colors and switch with the theme",
      "status": "accepted",
