      "expectation": "COM-A01 Settings, About, Web, User Agreement, Privacy Policy and Contributors pages: top content avoids the status bar (title bar / About toolbar is not covered by the status bar)\nCOM-A02 The settings page title is `设置` (large title bar with a back button) and shows groups top to bottom: `账号与安全` card, `外观与语言`, `隐私与协议`, `其他`, `通用`\nCOM-A03 Tapping `账号与安全` on the settings page navigates to the user profile page (UserRoutes Profile)\nCOM-A04 The `夜间模式` row on the settings page shows the current mode text on the right (`跟随系统`/`浅色模式`/`深色模式`); tapping it opens a bottom sheet titled `夜间模式` with three radio options\nCOM-A05 Choosing a theme mode in the bottom sheet immediately switches the whole app between light and dark (follow system / force light / force dark) and closes the sheet; reselecting the current mode changes nothing\nCOM-A06 The `主题颜色` row on the settings page shows a dot in the current theme color on the right; tapping it opens a bottom sheet titled `主题颜色` listing 5 options (`木槿紫`#465CFF, `幻彩紫`#6831FF, `清爽绿`#09BE4F, `暖日橙`#FFB703, `能量红`#FF2B2B), each with a color dot and a radio button\nCOM-A07 Choosing a theme color immediately replaces the app-wide primary color with that color and closes the sheet\nCOM-A08 The chosen theme mode and theme color are persisted (KV keys `settings_theme_mode`/`settings_theme_color`, values follow_system/light/dark and default/purple/green/orange/red) and still apply after a cold restart; a missing or invalid value falls back to follow system / `木槿紫`\nCOM-A09 The `语言切换` row on the settings page shows a fixed `中文` on the right, and tapping it does nothing (no language switching)\nCOM-A10 In the settings `隐私与协议` group, `隐私政策` opens the privacy policy page and `用户协议` opens the user agreement page\nCOM-A11 The settings `其他` group has a `不展示启动页` toggle (description `打开后进入应用将跳过启动页`, off by default, only page-local state, not persisted or wired to the launch flow) and `应用引导`, which opens the guide page with fromSettings=true\nCOM-A12 In the settings `通用` group, `清除缓存` shows a fixed `13.24MB` on the right and is not tappable, `意见反馈` opens the feedback list page, and `关于应用` opens the About page\nCOM-A23 On entry, the user agreement page requests GET base/comm/param?key=userAgreement and renders the returned HTML string in a WebView (JS disabled); the title is `用户协议`\nCOM-A24 On entry, the privacy policy page requests GET base/comm/param?key=privacyPolicy and renders the returned HTML; the title is `隐私政策`\nCOM-A25 The agreement/privacy pages show a document skeleton while loading (enforced minimum loading time) and a common error state with retry on failure that re-requests",
