      "expectation": "COM-A13 The About page header shows the app logo, the app name, and `Version <versionName>`; the info card lists `应用名称`, `版本号`, and `版本代码` (read from the package info)\nCOM-A14 The About page has a dynamic aurora background (dark/light variants, one light source in the theme color); as the page scrolls, the header fades and shrinks, and the `关于我们` title bar fades in; there is a back button\nCOM-A15 The About `开发者` group shows the avatar, `Joker.X`, and `joker.x.dev@gmail.com`; tapping it opens the Web page (https://github.com/Joker-x-dev, title Joker.X); the `贡献者` row opens the contributors page\nCOM-A16 About link rows each open the Web page with a fixed URL/title: `GitHub`, `Gitee`, `API 文档`(https://coolmall.apifox.cn), `Demo 下载`(pgyer), `图标来源`(github.com/tuniaoTech), `GitHub 讨论区`, `翻译`, `支持`, `帮助`, `开源许可`(LICENSE)\nCOM-A17 Tapping `QQ 交流群` and `微信交流群` on the About page does nothing (empty handler)\nCOM-A18 Under About `其他`, `用户协议`/`隐私政策` open the matching pages; the bottom shows `© 2025 Joker.X & CoolMallKotlin Contributors`\nCOM-A19 Tapping `引用` on the About page opens the `引用致谢` bottom sheet, which lists 21 local third-party dependencies (name, description up to 2 lines, category tag); tapping an item with a URL opens the Web page with the dependency name as title and closes the sheet\nCOM-A20 The Web page title bar first shows the route's title (default `网页` when none is given) and is then replaced by the page's real title; a linear progress bar shows below the top while loading progress is under 100\nCOM-A21 The Web page's top-right `更多选项` menu holds `刷新` (reload the current page) and `用浏览器打开` (open the route's initial URL in the system browser); the menu closes after either action\nCOM-A22 Inside the Web page, http/https links load in place, while non-http schemes (tel:/mailto:/geo:) are handed to system apps; JavaScript and DOM Storage are enabled\nCOM-A26 The contributors page (title `贡献者`) loads by page via POST user/contributor/page {page,size=10}, supporting pull-to-refresh and scroll-to-load-more, plus loading/empty/error-retry states\nCOM-A27 A contributor card shows the avatar, nickname, signature (when non-empty), and a tag row (when non-empty); tapping a card whose websiteUrl is non-empty opens the Web page with the nickname as title, otherwise nothing happens",
